# Product Requirements: Handl

## Problem
Millions of skilled local workers are on no app. Households find them by word of mouth, can't judge a fair price and get overcharged. Many workers can't type.

## Users
- Households needing repairs or scrap pickup
- Local workers (plumber, electrician, carpenter, kabadiwala)

## Goals
- Find the nearest suitable worker in under a minute
- Show a fair price range before booking
- Build trust with ratings, Trust Scores and verified ticks

## Built features
1. Animated homepage
2. Phone and OTP login (simulated)
3. Request by text, voice or photo
4. AI worker type, urgency and price range
5. Worker comparison cards
6. Map with worker tracking (simulated)
7. Worker flow: Accept, On the way, Arrived, Done
8. Two-way ratings and household Trust Score
9. Chat, Cancel and SOS

## Planned
- Real SMS OTP (Firebase), real GPS, payments, regional-language voice
- Google Antigravity for automated testing and code review

## Business model
Small commission per job, paid verified badges, yearly society plans

## Future scope
More trades, renovation-material resale, a work-history score for worker loans